<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Aetrium gets an accumulate.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Aetrium gets an accumulate.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Miller, Johnson &amp; Kuehn Inc said Friday it began coverage with an accumulate rating of Aetrium Inc, which supplies technologies and equipment to semiconductor and electronic components manufacturers to assemble and test integrated circuits.</p>
<p>Miller, Johnson said it expects Aetrium to benefit from what it sees as the beginning signs of a modest turnaround in the worldwide semiconductor industry.</p>
<p>Shares of Aetrium rose 5/8 to 19.</p>
<p>			 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
